    "https://careers.uh.edu/jobs/program-manager-student-organizations-and-leadership-houston-texas-united-states": {
      "title": "Apply now",
      "description": "Program Manager, Student Organizations and Leadership - Houston, Texas, United States UHS Home Job Search My Profile Kiosk mode Program Manager, Student Organizations and Leadership 496757 Full-Time Center for Student Engagement Add to favorites View favorites Department : Center for Student Engagement Salary : Commensurate with education and experience. Description : The Program Manager, Student Organizations and Leadership provides operational oversight for student organization support and development, leadership initiatives, civic and community engagement programs, and related student engagement systems. Supervises assigned staff and manages implementation of programs, services, communication, assessment, and administrative processes within assigned functional areas. Oversees student organization operations and engagement systems and coordinates leadership development opportunities, campus and community partnerships, and resources to support student development and achievement of departmental goals. Duties: Manages student organization support and development processes including registration, training, communication, engagement initiatives, and administration of related systems and services. Coordinates leadership initiatives and supports planning, implementation, and evaluation of leadership programs and student leadership experiences. Oversees civic and community engagement initiatives including service programs, volunteer engagement efforts, and related partnerships and outreach. Advises the Activities Funding Board and oversees related processes, funding administration, training, and decision implementation. Supervises assigned staff and student leadership teams through coaching, performance management, and staff development. Administers engagement systems and operational processes including workflows, records, communication, and service coordination. Coordinates assessment, evaluation, and reporting activities and utilizes findings to support continuous improvement efforts. Collaborates with office staff on all department programs, special projects, and other community building events. Collaborates with staff outside of the Center for Student Engagement to host events and activities. Serves on divisional and university-wide committees and advisory boards as well as supports late night and weekend programming. Performs related duties as assigned. Required Qualifications: Bachelor’s degree in Education, Business, Communication, Public Administration, Social Sciences, or related field. Minimum three years of experience in a higher education environment working in student engagement, student organizations, leadership development, civic engagement, student success, or related areas. Preferred Qualifications: Master’s degree in Higher Education Administration, Student Affairs, Educational Leadership, Public Administration, Business Administration, or related field. Progressively responsible experience supporting student organizations, leadership initiatives, program development, or related student engagement functions. Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: Knowledge of student engagement, student organization development, and leadership practices. Ability to work independently and collaboratively across functional areas. Skills in administration of engagement systems, records, and operational processes. Knowledge of program administration, assessment, and operational processes. Knowledge of group dynamics, supervision, and student development practices. Skills in collaborative planning, implementation, and coordination of programs and services. Ability to assess situations, solve problems, and adapt to changing priorities. Must have excellent written and verbal communication skills. Ability to supervise, train, and develop staff and student leaders. All positions at the University of Houston-System are security sensitive and will require a criminal history check. The University of Houston System and its universities are Equal Opportunity Institutions. Everyone is encouraged to apply. Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration 2:46 Loaded : 0.00% 0:00 Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 2:46 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Captions captions settings , opens captions settings dialog captions off , selected Audio Track Picture-in-Picture Fullscreen This is a modal window. Beginning of dialog window. Escape will cancel and close the window. Text Color White Black Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Text Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Transparent Caption Area Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Transparent Semi-Transparent Opaque Font Size 50% 75% 100% 125% 150% 175% 200% 300% 400% Text Edge Style None Raised Depressed Uniform Drop shadow Font Family Proportional Sans-Serif Monospace Sans-Serif Proportional Serif Monospace Serif Casual Script Small Caps Reset Done Close Modal Dialog End of dialog window. Apply now First Name (required) 62b0460d Last Name (required) 00661e7b Email (required) 2dacbd5c Cell number c5963bab 244 results found No results found Afghanistan (+93) Åland Islands (+358) Albania (+355) Algeria (+213) American Samoa (+1) Andorra (+376) Angola (+244) Anguilla (+1) Antigua & Barbuda (+1) Argentina (+54) Armenia (+374) Aruba (+297) Ascension Island (+247) Australia (+61) Austria (+43) Azerbaijan (+994) Bahamas (+1) Bahrain (+973) Bangladesh (+880) Barbados (+1) Belarus (+375) Belgium (+32) Belize (+501) Benin (+229) Bermuda (+1) Bhutan (+975) Bolivia (+591) Bosnia & Herzegovina (+387) Botswana (+267) Brazil (+55) British Indian Ocean Territory (+246) British Virgin Islands (+1) Brunei (+673) Bulgaria (+359) Burkina Faso (+226) Burundi (+257) Cambodia (+855) Cameroon (+237) Canada (+1) Ca